{"title":"Career roadmap — Tour Guide","role":"Tour Guide","summary":"A Tour Guide plans and leads visitors through destinations, explaining their history, culture, architecture, ecology, food and local traditions while managing logistics, safety and visitor experience. The strongest professionals combine destination knowledge + communication + storytelling + hospitality + cultural sensitivity + technology.","facts":{"Current degree":"BA (Bachelor of Arts – General / Honours)","Course":"Tourism & Hospitality Studies (BA)"},"about":[],"intro":[],"horizons":[],"sections":[{"heading":"Overview","kind":"other","blocks":[{"type":"p","text":"A Tour Guide plans and leads visitors through destinations, explaining their history, culture, architecture, ecology, food and local traditions while managing logistics, safety and visitor experience. The strongest professionals combine destination knowledge + communication + storytelling + hospitality + cultural sensitivity + technology."}]},{"heading":"Career horizons","kind":"horizons","blocks":[{"type":"table","header":["Period","Career focus"],"rows":[[{"text":"2026–2030"},{"text":"Build tourism knowledge, destination expertise, communication, storytelling and visitor-management skills"}],[{"text":"2030–2035"},{"text":"Work as a local, heritage, cultural, adventure or specialised tour guide"}],[{"text":"2035–2040"},{"text":"Progress into senior guiding, tour management, destination management or premium travel experiences"}],[{"text":"2040–2046"},{"text":"Lead destination programmes, build a specialist travel business or become a tourism/experience-management leader"}]]}]},{"heading":"What to build each year","kind":"build","blocks":[{"type":"h","text":"Year 1 — Tourism foundation"},{"type":"h","text":"Study:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Tourism geography"},{"text":"Indian history and culture"},{"text":"World heritage"},{"text":"Indian architecture"},{"text":"Art and literature"},{"text":"Hospitality fundamentals"},{"text":