":"Direct roles"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Tour Guide"},{"text":"Tourist Guide"},{"text":"Local Guide"},{"text":"Heritage Guide"},{"text":"Cultural Guide"},{"text":"Destination Guide"},{"text":"Museum Guide"},{"text":"Tour Executive"},{"text":"Travel Executive"},{"text":"Guest Experience Executive"}]},{"type":"h","text":"Adjacent roles"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Tour Coordinator"},{"text":"Tour Manager"},{"text":"Destination Specialist"},{"text":"Travel Consultant"},{"text":"Destination Management Executive"},{"text":"Guest Relations Executive"},{"text":"Travel Experience Designer"},{"text":"Tourism Marketing Executive"}]},{"type":"h","text":"Long-term roles"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Senior Tour Guide"},{"text":"Tour Manager"},{"text":"Destination Manager"},{"text":"Tourism Operations Manager"},{"text":"Head of Destination Experiences"},{"text":"Tourism Programme Manager"},{"text":"Travel Entrepreneur"},{"text":"Destination Management Consultant"}]}]},{"heading":"Postgraduate study in India","kind":"pg_india","blocks":[{"type":"p","text":"A postgraduate degree is not mandatory for becoming a tour guide. Practical experience, destination expertise and communication skills are often more important."},{"type":"table","header":["PG option","Best for"],"rows":[[{"text":"MA Tourism Management"},{"text":"Tourism leadership"}],[{"text":"MBA Tourism & Hospitality"},{"text":"Business/management"}],[{"text":"MA Travel & Tourism"},{"text":"Tourism operations"}],[{"text":"MSc Hospitality Management"},{"text":"Hospitality"}],[{"text":"MA Heritage Management"},{"text":"Heritage tourism"}],[{"text":"MA Cultural Studies"},{"text":"Cultural tourism"}],[{"text":"MA History"},{"text":"Heritage guiding"}],[{"text":"MA Archaeology"},{"text":"Archaeological destinations"}],[{"text":"MA Sustainable Tourism"},{"text":"Eco-tourism"}],[{"text":"PG Diploma in Tourism"},{"text":"Professional specialisation"}]]},{"type":"h","text":"Recommended route"},{"type":"flow","ite