:["Guide","Specialist Tour Operator","Boutique Travel Company","Premium Destination Experiences","Travel Brand"]},{"type":"note","label":"Emerging specialisations","text":"2030–2040"},{"type":"h","text":"1. Experience-based tourism"},{"type":"p","text":"Travellers increasingly seek experiences rather than standard sightseeing:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Local food"},{"text":"Crafts"},{"text":"Traditional activities"},{"text":"Local communities"},{"text":"Cultural workshops"},{"text":"Farm experiences"},{"text":"Storytelling tours"}]},{"type":"h","text":"2. AI-assisted tourism"},{"type":"h","text":"AI can help guides with:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Itinerary creation"},{"text":"Translation"},{"text":"Personalised recommendations"},{"text":"Historical research"},{"text":"Route planning"},{"text":"Visitor preferences"},{"text":"Digital interpretation"}]},{"type":"p","text":"The guide remains responsible for accuracy and real-world judgement."},{"type":"h","text":"3. AR/VR heritage tourism"},{"type":"h","text":"Future guides may use:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"AR historical reconstructions"},{"text":"3D monuments"},{"text":"Virtual museums"},{"text":"Digital archaeological reconstructions"},{"text":"Interactive maps"}]},{"type":"h","text":"4. Sustainable tourism"},{"type":"h","text":"Increasing importance of:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Carrying capacity"},{"text":"Waste reduction"},{"text":"Local community participation"},{"text":"Conservation"},{"text":"Responsible wildlife tourism"},{"text":"Low-impact transportation"}]},{"type":"h","text":"5. Luxury and personalised tourism"},{"type":"h","text":"Premium travellers increasingly want:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Private guides"},{"text":"Bespoke itineraries"},{"text":"Culinary experiences"},{"text":"Art and culture"},{"text":"Local access"},{"text":"Wellness"},{"text":"Exclusive experiences"}]},{"type":"h","text":"6. Multilingual tourism"},{"type":"p","text":"Foreign-language abi